    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/301300201/3013002010300"
  },
  {
    "id": 3013002010310,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "ふ、ふたりともすごい想像してるわね……\r\n多少はあってるかもしれないけど……",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/301300201/3013002010310"
  },
  {
    "id": 3013002010320,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "でも、お風呂だけは毎日、時間をかけて\r\nたっぷりと入っているわよ。入浴は健康の基本なの",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/301300201/3013002010320"
  },
  {
    "id": 3013002010330,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "私たちは歌ったり、踊ったりするのが仕事でしょ？\r\nだからこそ、お風呂でしっかりと疲れを取る必要があるわ",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/301300201/3013002010330"
  },
  {
    "id": 3013002010340,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "それに、美容の観点から見ても\r\nお風呂っていうのは大事で……",
